WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.563
The curated table should not just be a copy of the
raw data It should

00:00:05.589 --> 00:00:11.533
have useful types deliberate columns and a
documented row grain For

00:00:11.546 --> 00:00:17.194
example a monthly sales table may have one row per
product and month A readmission

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.641
table may have one row per repeat admission
